codex
The interaction layer is now wired: keyboard copy/paste/duplicate ignores editable fields; node, edge, and canvas menus expose the relevant actions; replacement previews incompatible edge loss before confirmation; and releasing a connection on empty canvas opens a type-filtered insertion palette. I’ve added focused tests for each underlying operation and am checking the full frontend suite now.
