- Ctrl+C, Ctrl+V, and Ctrl+D shortcuts with multi-node/internal-edge support.
- Node, edge, and canvas context menus.
- Compatibility-aware, undoable node replacement with connection-loss warnings.
- Connection-drop palette filtered by compatible ports with atomic insert-and-connect.
